{"id":"296e574c4ef84f16","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-wellorder.md","title":"Well-Ordering","display":"df-wellorder — Well-Ordering","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-wellorder","aliases":["58-df-wellorder","58-df-wor"],"display":"df-wellorder — Well-Ordering","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-relation.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-wellorder"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-wellorder</span><span>58-df-wor</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-wellorder — Well-Ordering"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7ccfc8c88f29968a\" href=\"?note=7ccfc8c88f29968a\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-relation.md\">../batch18/58-df-relation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X \\in V\">\\(X \\in V\\)</span> (underlying set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq X\\times X\">\\(R\\subseteq X\\times X\\)</span>，并约定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"xRy\">\\(xRy\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x&lt;_Ry\">\\(x&lt;_Ry\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7ccfc8c88f29968a\" href=\"?note=7ccfc8c88f29968a\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-relation.md\">../batch18/58-df-relation.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S(R,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S(R,X)\\)</span>（本文件定义的严格良序谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}wellorder} \\vdash \\mathrm{WellOrder}_S(R,X) \\leftrightarrow\\left(R\\subseteq X\\times X\\land(\\forall x\\in X\\;(x,x)\\notin R)\\land(\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall y\\in X\\;\\forall z\\in X\\;(((x,y)\\in R\\land(y,z)\\in R)\\to(x,z)\\in R))\\land(\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall y\\in X\\;(x\\neq y\\to((x,y)\\in R\\lor(y,x)\\in R)))\\land(\\forall S\\subseteq X\\;(S\\neq\\emptyset\\to\\exists m\\in S\\;\\forall x\\in S\\;((x,m)\\notin R)))\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}wellorder} \\vdash \\mathrm{WellOrder}_S(R,X) \\leftrightarrow\\left(R\\subseteq X\\times X\\land(\\forall x\\in X\\;(x,x)\\notin R)\\land(\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall y\\in X\\;\\forall z\\in X\\;(((x,y)\\in R\\land(y,z)\\in R)\\to(x,z)\\in R))\\land(\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall y\\in X\\;(x\\neq y\\to((x,y)\\in R\\lor(y,x)\\in R)))\\land(\\forall S\\subseteq X\\;(S\\neq\\emptyset\\to\\exists m\\in S\\;\\forall x\\in S\\;((x,m)\\notin R)))\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><code>58-df-wor</code> is merged here; it was the class-membership notation for well-ordered relations.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"7ccfc8c88f29968a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"7ccfc8c88f29968a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$R\\subseteq X\\times X$，并约定 $xRy$ 表示 $x<_Ry$（see [[../batch18/58-df-relation.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq X\\times X","display":false},{"tex":"xRy","display":false},{"tex":"x<_Ry","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S(R,X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}wellorder} \\vdash \\mathrm{WellOrder}_S(R,X) \\leftrightarrow\\left(R\\subseteq X\\times X\\land(\\forall x\\in X\\;(x,x)\\notin R)\\land(\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall y\\in X\\;\\forall z\\in X\\;(((x,y)\\in R\\land(y,z)\\in R)\\to(x,z)\\in R))\\land(\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall y\\in X\\;(x\\neq y\\to((x,y)\\in R\\lor(y,x)\\in R)))\\land(\\forall S\\subseteq X\\;(S\\neq\\emptyset\\to\\exists m\\in S\\;\\forall x\\in S\\;((x,m)\\notin R)))\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":1065,"backlinks":[{"id":"cb435cbd7ac2a88e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2$ 为 [[58-df-wellorder.md]] 的严格良序谓词，参数順序为关系、载体。"},{"id":"b404eb64598c2615","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S$（良序谓词，see [[../batch02/58-df-wellorder.md]]）"},{"id":"31047aff4d4351a5","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"aaa964c587dcf4f8","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"The relation $R$ is strict, matching the irreflexive convention in [[../batch02/58-df-wellorder.md]]."},{"id":"d8196ceb5f6e3532","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-wellorder.md]])"},{"id":"1c0b1655f45efa9d","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-wellorder.md]])"},{"id":"5d2cd56a38a81b7a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S(\\in_\\alpha,\\alpha)$（严格良序谓词，见 [[../batch02/58-df-wellorder.md]]）"},{"id":"f06e57c5c0b1354d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset},\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]] and [[../batch02/58-df-wellorder.md]])"},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-102","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[58-df-wellorder]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1390","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-wellorder.md|58-df-wellorder]]（batch02）"},{"id":"7334957c6d59eacc","anchor":"ref-130","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-def-operator.md]]\n[[58-df-l-hierarchy.md]]\n[[58-df-p-name.md]]\n[[58-df-aleph.md]]\n[[58-df-antichain.md]]\n[[58-df-baire-property.md]]\n[[58-df-beth-function.md]]\n[[58-df-bijective.md]]\n[[58-df-borel.md]]\n[[58-df-bounded.md]]\n[[58-df-branch.md]]\n[[58-df-cardinal.md]]\n[[58-df-cardinaladd.md]]\n[[58-df-cardinalclass.md]]\n[[58-df-cardinalexpp.md]]\n[[58-df-cardinality.md]]\n[[58-df-cardinalmul.md]]\n[[58-df-cartesian.md]]\n[[58-df-cauchy.md]]\n[[58-df-cauchyseq.md]]\n[[58-df-ch.md]]\n[[58-df-chain.md]]\n[[58-df-closed.md]]\n[[58-df-club-filter.md]]\n[[58-df-club.md]]\n[[58-df-cofinality.md]]\n[[58-df-compatible.md]]\n[[58-df-constructible-universe.md]]\n[[58-df-continuous.md]]\n[[58-df-continuum.md]]\n[[58-df-countable.md]]\n[[58-df-critical-point.md]]\n[[58-df-ctm.md]]\n[[58-df-dedekind-cut.md]]\n[[58-df-dense.md]]\n[[58-df-diamond.md]]\n[[58-df-diff.md]]\n[[58-df-disjoint.md]]\n[[58-df-domain.md]]\n[[58-df-dual-ideal.md]]\n[[58-df-elementary-embedding.md]]\n[[58-df-elementary-substructure.md]]\n[[58-df-emptyset.md]]\n[[58-df-epsilon0.md]]\n[[58-df-epsilonnumber.md]]\n[[58-df-equinumerous.md]]\n[[58-df-equivalence.md]]\n[[58-df-equiva